    <string name="about_text">Go Game Analysis+OGS is a free, open source Go app (5x5 to 21x21). You can also play people on OGS (online-go.com); this is not an official OGS app. The AI is KataGo (https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo) running entirely on your device, with official KataGo networks: with the "Strong" network setting, kata9x9-b18c384nbt-20231025 on 9x9 and kata1-b18c384nbt on other boards; with "Fast", g170e-b10c128 on every board.\n\nSource code: https://github.com/tamaikeiichi/GoAI</string>
